      "text": "By the in-ter-ces-sions of Thy Mar-tyrs, O Lord, grant rest un-to the souls of Thy ser-vants.\n\nAs show-ing forth a proof of wis-dom high and great and the gifts of Thy good-ness be-yond all price, Mas-ter, Thou hast gra-cious-ly num-bered the Mar-tyrs’ bless-ed choirs with the An-gels as their fel-low__ heirs.__\n\nTheir souls shall dwell a-mong good__ things.\n\nVouch-safe that those con-veyed from hence to Thee, O Christ, may at-tain to Thy glo-ry un-speak-a-ble, where there is the dwell-ing of them that are glad e-ter-nal-ly and the sound of pure ex-ceed-ing__ joy.__\n\nGlo-ry to the Fa-ther, and to the Son, and to the Ho--ly Spir-it.\n\nRe-ceive all them that praise Thy sov-’reign might di-vine, whom from earth Thou hast tak-en un-to Thy-self, ren-der-ing them sons of light, cleans-ing them from the gloom of sin, O most mer-ci-ful and Friend of__ man.__\n\nBoth now and ev--er, and un-to the ag--es of ag-es. A-men.\n\nThou art the come-li-ness of Ja-cob, whom the Lord chose to be His im-mac-u-late dwell-ing-place, vir-gin place of ho-li-ness, pure and all-ho-ly ark of God, and the tem-ple free of an-y__ stain.__"
    }
  }
}